Z||000027||NOCONES||12-10-2001||12:08 AM||||What are people running with caddy 4.9's in fieros.  I haven't seen many people running sub 13's in fieros.. there are some, but none of them did the miracle 1-2grand swap and ran sub 12's.  for 1-2 g's you could probably get a mustang down around 11.5-12.5.. keep in mind gt fieros don't wiegh to much less than mustang 5.0's from the early 90's, and making up the 400lb difference would only take 40hp  and i know you could get that in a mustang for 1-2g's<BR>but the fiero would whop it's ass at any type of road course..<P>caddy 4.9L swap<BR>1-2K   300HP  2900lbs approx    1hp/9.7lbs<P>mustang 5.0L +<BR>supercharger + 100shot Nos + 4.10 ford 9in.<BR>1-2K  350-400hp  3300lbs approx  <BR>1hp/9.5lbs - 1hp/8.25lbs<P><BR>not a flame on anyone, just some facts||||reg||1
