Z||000101||FieroSTETZ||12-13-2001||02:10 AM||||I really don't understand a lot of people. Not to pick on BS95, but so many people have the mentality "someone else has a similar car that is really fast, so mine is too" I would guarantee that any car in the posession of ANYONE in my immediate family would tear the balls off of a six cylinder mustang (even got a '67 beetle that would do it to a 12 second one hehe) but the entire thing comes to "prove it" go to the track, come back with timeslips- there are so many "bench racers" in the world- the thing i worry most about (w/ these people) is that they are going to go out on the street and try to prove it. A mustang is a mustang. a fiero is a fiero. a 12 second fiero will kill a 13 second mustang, and vice versa. I made the conscious decision not to pay attention to peoples posts anymore, the second they try to say ANYTHING about a mustang, because i know some mind numbing gibberish is soon to follow. <BR>I know my posts are usually not well thought out, and people are going to pick on this one (most likely) but its how I feel, and probably others as well. We really dont care if someone has a mustang. or a motorcycle. or a pink barbie corvette. (well, maybe a pink barbie corvette) as long as you have a car, enjoy your car, and can respect other people who own and enjoy their cars, you are welcome here. theres an old saying, its better to be thought a fool than to open your mouth and prove it. read that and think... have i ever refrained from proving... I am going to sleep now, hit work at 7 am, off at 10:30 pm... love the christmas season. <P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.shawnrocks.com/Animation1.gif"> ||||reg||1
